   "design": "Drivers log contaminated bins in the on-board app with a photo and address. The coordinator sees one list with each address's service and the ordinance rule, instead of reading paper reports and looking things up. Warning letters fill from the logged case, and the coordinator checks and sends them. Site visits, calls about repeat problems and hauler meetings stay with the coordinator. Logs record bins, not drivers' routes, and fines stay with the investigator.",
